<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Biogen cut to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Biogen cut to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said it downgraded Biogen Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 3-1/8 to 35-5/8.</p>
</text>
